                    <!-- Step 1: Niche -->
                    <div id="niche" class="scroll-target" style="margin-top: 35px;">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            Step 1: Decide Your Niche and Your Ideal Client
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            This is the step almost everybody skips, and it is the #1 reason most astrology marketing fails. Saying <em>"I do all types of astrology"</em> is not positioning — it sounds generic like everyone else. Instead, pick a clear specialty:
                        </p>

                        <div class="kdm-card-grid">
                            <div class="kdm-feature-card">
                                <div class="kdm-card-icon blue"><i class="fa fa-heart"></i></div>
                                <h4>Marriage &amp; Match-Making</h4>
                                <p>Kundli Milan, Guna Dosha analysis, delay in marriage solutions, and manglik dosha remedies.</p>
                                <span class="lead-meta-tag"><i class="fa fa-bolt" style="color:#eab308;"></i> High Urgency</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-feature-card">
                                <div class="kdm-card-icon orange"><i class="fa fa-briefcase"></i></div>
                                <h4>Career &amp; Job Astrology</h4>
                                <p>Government job predictions, promotion timing, business partner compatibility, and overseas settlement.</p>
                                <span class="lead-meta-tag"><i class="fa fa-chart-line" style="color:#0284c7;"></i> High Volume</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-feature-card">
                                <div class="kdm-card-icon green"><i class="fa fa-globe-americas"></i></div>
                                <h4>NRI &amp; International Clients</h4>
                                <p>Serving Indian diaspora across USA, UK, Canada, Australia, and UAE paying premium USD/GBP/CAD fees.</p>
                                <span class="lead-meta-tag"><i class="fa fa-dollar-sign" style="color:#16a34a;"></i> 5x–10x Ticket Size</span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="kdm-feature-card">
                                <div class="kdm-card-icon purple"><i class="fa fa-compass"></i></div>
                                <h4>Vastu &amp; Numerology</h4>
                                <p>Commercial Vastu, residential energy balancing, name numerology, and tarot consultations.</p>
                                <span class="lead-meta-tag"><i class="fa fa-gem" style="color:#9333ea;"></i> Premium B2B Margins</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            When your message is sharp, your customer acquisition cost drops and booking rates skyrocket. A person searching <em>"career problem astrologer"</em> will always choose the specialist who says <strong>"Career Astrology Expert"</strong> over a generalist claiming <em>"All Solutions Available"</em>.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 2: Website -->
                    <div id="website" class="scroll-target" style="margin-top: 35px;">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            Step 2: Build a Professional Astrology Website
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            Your website is your digital office. Social media is rented land where algorithms change overnight; your website is property you own permanently.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            A high-converting astrology website built with modern <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/website-design-services.aspx">website design services</a> requires:
                        </p>
                        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 2;">
                            <li><strong>Clear Authority Headline:</strong> Who you are, your core lineage/specialty, and verified years of experience.</li>
                            <li><strong>Dedicated Service Landing Pages:</strong> Separate rankable pages for Kundli Reading, Match Making, Career Astrology, Vastu, and Gemstone Advice.</li>
                            <li><strong>Sticky "Book Consultation" CTA:</strong> Visible on every screen across desktop and mobile without scrolling.</li>
                            <li><strong>Instant Payment Gateway:</strong> Seamless integration with UPI, Razorpay, PayU, and PayPal/Stripe for international clients.</li>
                            <li><strong>Automated Calendar Booking:</strong> Slot-booking systems (Calendly or custom) allowing clients to book without calling back and forth.</li>
                            <li><strong>Interactive Free Tools:</strong> Built-in free Kundli generator, Horoscope matching tool, daily rashifal, and numerology calculators to capture high lead volume.</li>
                            <li><strong>Fast Mobile Speed:</strong> Over 85% of astrology traffic in India is on mobile devices.</li>
                            <li><strong>One-Click WhatsApp Button:</strong> This single conversion element can double your incoming enquiries immediately.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 3: Astrology SEO -->
                    <div id="seo" class="scroll-target" style="margin-top: 35px;">
                        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding-left: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            Step 3: Astrology SEO — The Best Long-Term Client Source
                        </h2>
                        <p>
                            <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/SEO-Services.aspx">SEO (Search Engine Optimisation)</a> means getting your website on page 1 of Google without paying for every single click. In astrology, SEO is the single most profitable channel because commercial intent is extraordinary. Someone searching <em>"astrologer for marriage problem"</em> is actively seeking immediate help with credit card in hand.
                        </p>

                        <div class="kdm-channels-grid">
                            <div class="kdm-channel-card">
                                <h4><i class="fa fa-search" style="color: #0284c7;"></i> High-Intent Keywords</h4>
                                <p>Target terms like <em>"best astrologer in India"</em>, <em>"online astrology consultation"</em>, <em>"kundli matching for marriage"</em>, <em>"talk to astrologer online"</em>, and city terms like <em>"famous astrologer in Delhi / Mumbai"</em>.</p>
                            </div>
